<title>HONG KONG: IDBI seen launching FRN in March.</title>
<headline>IDBI seen launching FRN in March.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Industrial Bank of India (IDBI) is expected to launch a seven-year US$150 million floating rate note issue later this month, bankers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch is the bookrunner and lead manager. BA Asia, ABN Amro and SBC Warburg are joint lead managers.</p>
<p>Roadshows will be held in Asia next week, they said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
